  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="89a522e2-fa1b-51cb-99e6-1d326ef8391c" activityNameId="d1cb463e-a73a-5f93-b5c8-acaeb59b5439" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">xx Hay extensive, at farm</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xx Hay extensive, at farm
Refers to 1 kg dry matter of field-dried hay from extensive production. The net dry matter yield is 9863 kg/ha.;
UUID: 89bf075e-13f2-35b5-8573-7666495687f4
The inventories include the cultivation of hay on a permanent meadow. Included steps the harvest, the transport to the farm and the storage in the barn during 12 months. Drying occurs only on the meadow.
Location: Refers to a production in the Swiss plateau (lowlands &lt;700m).
Technology: Extensive production with drying in the field.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: 85985 ha extensive meadows in Switzerland 2004
Sampling: Data were compiled from statistics, fertilising recommendations, documents from extension services and expert knowledge. 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_89bf075e-13f2-35b5-8573-7666495687f4.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
